  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multilateral Humanitarian Assistance for the People of Afghanistan - 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through UN partners in Afghanistan and Pakistan for the provision of food, protection and health support to vulnerable communities with a focus on women and girls, people with a disability, internally displaced persons, returnees and people affected by conflict, natural disasters and economic stress. UN partners will deliver funding in line with the UN&apos;s annual Afghanistan Humanitarian Needs and Response Plan and Afghanistan Situation Regional Refugee Response Plan. Australia&apos;s aid program also aligns with DFAT&apos;s Afghanistan Development Partnership Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
